{
 "about": "The site record.py serves while it records, and what each scenario's pages did (the ground truth the recorded output is read against). {SITE}, {OTHER} and {CLOSED} are the fixed local origins, {SOCKET} is {CLOSED} as a ws: URL. requests: every request the explorer's network record lists (static: false), with the status the page got or FAILED and Chromium's reason. hidden: requests it leaves out, which static: true lists. answered: requests the page record must hold as answered below 400, static ones included. console: [kind, text the entry starts with or holds] per distinct error the console log holds; pages: the page record's URL for each.",
